# Figure presentation (empirical paper)

Canonical implementation: `scripts/paper_pipeline/lib/pef_figure_style.m`.
Use `config()`, `add_panel_letter`, `style_scatter_axes`, `export_figure`.
Do not set font sizes or titles by hand in published figure scripts.

Applies to main Figures 1--3 and SI S1--S8. Diagnostic notebooks
(`pef_information_content_*.m`, synthetic ML validation, probit smoke plots)
are exempt.

## Type

| Element | Size | `config` field |
|---------|------|----------------|
| Axis labels, colourbar labels | 12 pt (minimum 10 pt) | `fs_label` |
| Tick labels, contour clabels | 10 pt | `fs_tick` |
| Panel letters, KPI names, `n=`, notes | 12 pt | `fs_annot` |
| Legends, Q1--Q4 tags | 12 pt | `fs_panel`, `fs_quad` |

Export at 300 dpi (`export_figure`). White figure background.

## Titles and captions

- No axes `title` / `sgtitle` on published figures.
- Narrative lives in the LaTeX caption (`sections/tables_and_figures.tex`, `sections/supplementary.tex`).
- Captions use (A), (B), (C) to match panel letters. British English.

## Panel letters

- Multi-panel figures: `(A)`, `(B)`, `(C)` via `pef_figure_style.add_panel_letter`.
- Sit **inside** the axes, default northwest inset (~5% from top-left).
- White background, 12 pt bold. Optional `Note` on the same line (e.g. `\delta/\sigma_A`).
- Use another corner only when northwest sits on data (document why).
- Single-panel figures do not need a letter.

## Legends and annotations

- Legends 12 pt, box off. Place in empty space, not on data, bars, or curves.
- Do not let labels overlap each other, markers, or panel letters.
- If a name has no free slot, omit it (keep the marker). Prefer collision-aware placement.
- Dense maps (SI S2 football): thinning is allowed; say so in the caption.

## Axes

- Bar charts of non-negative summaries start at zero (`ylim_bars_from_zero`).
- Do not leave an empty negative floor when every mean is ~0 or above.
- Colour: Q1 green, Q2 blue, Q3 orange, Q4 red (`quadrant_color`).
- Landscape limits: `\rho\in[-0.999,0.999]`, `\kappa\in[0.001,3]`.

## Pre-export check

1. No title on the figure.
2. Panel letters inside the box, same corner across panels.
3. Axis labels 12 pt, ticks 10 pt, annotations and legends 12 pt.
4. Legend and labels clear of data.
5. Caption describes panels without repeating a figure title.

## Regeneration

- Figures 1--2: `scripts/paper_pipeline/regen_fig1.m`, `regen_fig2.m`
- Figure 3: `scripts/matlab_figures/regenerate_figure_3_from_outputs.m`
- SI S1--S8: `scripts/matlab_figures/generate_all_si_figures.m`
